WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.008 --> 00:00:25.320
The fox led Jemima to his shed.

2
00:00:25.321 --> 00:00:28.786
Jemima looked inside.

3
00:00:28.787 --> 00:00:32.213
"Hmm," said Jemima.

4
00:00:32.214 --> 00:00:36.556
"Why are there so many feathers in there?"

5
00:00:36.557 --> 00:00:41.060
The fox didn't answer.

6
00:00:41.061 --> 00:00:47.563
"It does look warm and cozy," said Jemima.

7
00:00:47.564 --> 00:00:50.022
So Jemima went in.

8
00:00:50.023 --> 00:00:55.572
She gathered straw and feathers.

9
00:00:55.573 --> 00:01:02.162
Soon she had a nice, warm nest.

10
00:01:02.163 --> 00:01:06.447
"I'll be back tomorrow," she said.

11
00:01:06.448 --> 00:01:12.119
"I'll take care of your nest," said the fox.

12
00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:16.471
"You're so kind!" said Jemima.

13
00:01:16.472 --> 00:01:28.112
"Thank you."

14
00:01:28.113 --> 00:01:33.887
Each day Jemima came to the shed.

15
00:01:33.888 --> 00:01:38.059
She went inside and laid an egg.

16
00:01:38.060 --> 00:02:08.409
Then she went home in the evening.

17
00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:14.544
Each night the fox counted the eggs.

18
00:02:14.545 --> 00:02:18.040
He turned them over and smiled.

19
00:02:18.041 --> 00:02:21.938
"They're so big!" he said.

20
00:02:21.939 --> 00:02:29.072
"They look delicious!"

21
00:02:29.073 --> 00:02:36.247
At last nine eggs filled the nest.

22
00:02:36.248 --> 00:02:39.489
"I'm done," Jemima said.

23
00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:42.876
"I'll be back tomorrow.

24
00:02:42.877 --> 00:02:48.372
Then I'll stay until my eggs hatch."

25
00:02:48.373 --> 00:02:52.592
"Wonderful!" said the fox.

26
00:02:52.593 --> 00:02:55.880
He licked his lips.

27
00:02:55.881 --> 00:03:00.946
"Please bring some herbs tomorrow," he said.

28
00:03:00.947 --> 00:03:07.870
"I will cook a big dinner for us!"
